                    "script": "\tselectedRow \u003d self.parent.parent.getChild(\"FlexContainer_0\").getChild(\"Table\").props.selection.data[0]\n\t\n\tparameters \u003d {\u0027newEntry\u0027: 0,\n\t\t\t\u0027stepID\u0027: selectedRow.StepID,\n\t\t\t\u0027name\u0027: selectedRow.Name,\n\t\t\t\u0027seqNr\u0027: selectedRow.SequenceNumber,\n\t\t\t\u0027procedureID\u0027: self.view.params.procedureID\n\t\t\t}\n\t\n\tsystem.perspective.openDock(\u0027StepsDock\u0027, params \u003d parameters)"
